{
  "abstract": "A Lean formalization of quantifier elimination for algebraically closed fields, nontrivially valued algebraically closed fields in the ordinary valued-field language, and the corrected two-sorted RV language with named RV inversion. This Comparator configuration checks those three entry points. Only nontrivial valuations are included in the valued-field claims.",
